<h2>How His Frame Compares</h2>
<div class="rank-card">
<div class="rank-title">Mendoza's Measurements vs Notable QB Prospects</div>
<div class="rank-row">
<div class="rank-label"><strong>Height</strong>6'4.75"</div>
