</div>
<div class="rank-row">
<div class="rank-label"><strong>Weight</strong>236 lbs</div>
<div class="rank-track"><div class="rank-fill" style="width:82%;background:#aaff00"></div></div>
<div class="rank-val">Matches Josh Allen</div>
</div>
<div class="rank-row">
<div class="rank-label"><strong>Arm Length</strong>31 7/8"</div>
<div class="rank-track"><div class="rank-fill" style="width:70%;background:#aaff00"></div></div>
