<div class="faq-q">How did Fernando Mendoza perform in his NFL preseason debut?</div>
<div class="faq-a">Mendoza completed 10 of 16 passes for 97 yards and a touchdown against the Arizona Cardinals, adding 6 rushing yards on 2 carries. He earned a 66.7 overall grade from PFF and avoided any turnover-worthy plays across his 31 snaps.</div>
